71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dn1yh9QUSw4Q7kNvwGItEIq&_nc_oc=Ado95bfaTgT6Tmz-CH-RGTwYe6nYjOUNArGrf7GjURJkJoU2aasEZ3t8I-pZRxzwxlg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMSmz8v5fhoQWkjhxuZERf8hK6xCY5kSBRw-SZt7F_apw&oe=6ADDFFB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-6EvTqZ671UQ7kNvwHkNWuE&_nc_oc=AdpEk1bGwB6BUJpSSg5FOviyWo4924YbD0FW7aed-g2hrNSwmr9Mho6Ba8di5oRdq1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMZ9S6aAnDULJ0zl3fmFkI4xdtzkGgbKT-9GUhqhoPanQ&oe=6ADE1293"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HV5TGtCSj7YQ7kNvwEfSDGV&_nc_oc=AdpFqjIpIRZdy6ycronspvO8SmFMgRhz0j5iNtYEmnvLzyV-LXuAGr84BL6N2cNWK1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNvfxS5wHJXBnnxNKo7gTvpG_7ouBXQjGPeWo3lC5OIww&oe=6ADE10DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: